                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8dea01cb-c521-39b4-a854-c3e7532ffb25",
                        "entry_id": "1177d084-3499-3bd8-877d-89fa4af4c1a4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "圖瓦盧，吐瓦魯（大洋洲之玻里尼西亞的國家和群島）"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "24ac4f1a-dbd4-4e19-abf3-5bcabf99cb95",
                                "sense_id": "8dea01cb-c521-39b4-a854-c3e7532ffb25",
                                "text": "Tuvalu, a string of islands northwest of Australia, sold the rights to its suffix, “.tv,” to a Canadian entrepreneur for $50 million, and used the money to put electricity on the outer islands, create scholarships and finance the process to join the United Nations.",
                                "translation": "吐瓦魯，位於澳洲西北部的一串島嶼，以5000萬美元的價格將其後綴「.tv」的權利賣給了一位加拿大企業家，並用這筆錢為外島通電、設立獎學金以及資助加入聯合國的進程。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9e90e40-581a-4744-ad97-9e4553608bdd",
                                "sense_id": "8dea01cb-c521-39b4-a854-c3e7532ffb25",
                                "text": "This marks Lin’s [譯 林 (Lín)] third visit to Tuvalu. During a welcome ceremony, Lin said he was pleased to see Prime Minister Feleti Teo and other senior officials and looked forward to reviewing projects showcasing bilateral cooperation.",
                                "translation": "這是林部長第三次訪問吐瓦魯。在歡迎儀式上，林表示很高興見到總理費萊蒂·特奧（Feleti Teo）和其他高級官員，並期待回顧展現雙邊合作的項目。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ]
    }
